// RUN: cd %corpus && ! %zomc compile --check 09-interfaces/impl_trait_method_body_receiverless_capability_neg_50.zom > %t 2>&1
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --input-file %t

// A concrete receiverless method supplied by a standalone `impl Interface for
// Type` block publishes its signature so coherence observes the impl, but the
// method body does not lower yet. The definition drains as ZOM4099 instead of
// reaching a checker invariant.

// CHECK-LITERAL: Error [ZOM4099]: this function body uses a construct the compiler cannot generate code for yet
// CHECK-LITERAL:   --> conformance/09-interfaces/impl_trait_method_body_receiverless_capability_neg_50.zom:5:5
